<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Burswood half yr profit rises 84 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Burswood half yr profit rises 84 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    40.85 vs 23.09</p>
<p>    Net				     25.20 vs 13.73</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     6.5  vs 4.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Burswood Property Trust is the owner and operator of the Burswood casino in Perth.</p>
